  "contracts": [
    "CPU/APU instruction implementations, native Audio execution/transcription, ProjectStore, RuntimeCompiler, prior mapper branches and non-Punch-Out game decoders remain byte-identical.",
    "The original Punch-Out v1 decoder is retained byte-for-byte for existing saved projects. New imports select the corrected v2 profile; old saved projects keep their original recipes.",
    "The correction records the same renderer fetches; synthetic comparisons verify unchanged frame pixels and MMC2 latch state, including clipped fetches.",
    "Source header compatibility ignores padding bytes 12\u201315 only; semantic header fields and bounded source/audio data still gate recognition."
  ]
